# Placed at repo root (build context). Keeps the image lean and
# avoids accidentally baking host-machine node_modules/build output
# (which may not match the container's architecture) into the image.

**/node_modules
**/build
datasets/
load-generator/
docker/
.git
.gitignore
*.md
# Zig build artifacts — host-built output must never leak into the image;
# the builder stage compiles the allocator from source inside the container.
**/zig-out
**/.zig-cache
**/zig-cache
